8536|n|A game of chance, in which a small ball is made to move round rapidly on a circle divided off into numbered red and black spaces, the one on which it stops indicating the result of a variety of wagers permitted by the game. ; A small toothed wheel used by engravers to roll over a plate in order to order to produce rows of dots. ; A similar wheel used to roughen the surface of a plate, as in making alterations in a mezzotint. ; the curve traced by any point in the plane of a given curve when the latter rolls, without sliding, over another fixed curve. See Cycloid, and Epycycloid.	a:877v,122,977;30yt,79,40;bob,68,47;wo5,60,6;35mc,49,17;2tia,48,7;3gx5,24,2;6n1f,23,6;83ky,20,1;8p3m,15,18;7rjb,13,11;90mt,11,8;sn4,9,4;5b7l,3,5;76vy,1,1~877v,122,977;bob,68,47;30yt,79,40;8p3m,15,18;35mc,49,17;7rjb,13,11;90mt,11,8;2tia,48,7;wo5,60,6;6n1f,23,6;5b7l,3,5;sn4,9,4;6eqb,1,3;3gx5,24,2;76vy,1,1	v:76vy,64,77;wo5,57,5;akp8,56,8;r23,55,7;8xn7,52,4;76my,36,26;9snk,26,3;76og,23,2;969d,13,5;1883,11,12~76vy,64,77;76my,36,26;1883,11,12;akp8,56,8;r23,55,7;wo5,57,5;969d,13,5;8xn7,52,4;9snk,26,3;76og,23,2	V:w39,82,10;3k13,79,5;9saf,65,4;8xnv,53,2;akp8,52,6;53lm,49,2;93qk,35,5;aiv4,34,4;842m,28,1;443f,25,2;33h0,0,2~w39,82,10;akp8,52,6;93qk,35,5;3k13,79,5;aiv4,34,4;9saf,65,4;8xnv,53,2;53lm,49,2;443f,25,2;33h0,0,2;842m,28,1	n:151r,131,3;1azs,99,12;75ig,89,10;1ado,77,9;5l3l,63,4;l34,54,9;52of,42,5;19gg,38,7;76vy,36,11;3gx5,34,4;8xn7,32,1;8fx6,31,6;2tia,30,2;n7b,27,1;76my,24,11~598y,3,51;1azs,99,12;76my,24,11;w46,1,11;76vy,36,11;75ig,89,10;1ado,77,9;l34,54,9;19gg,38,7;8fx6,31,6;7f4g,14,5;52of,42,5;66js,20,4;6tvj,6,4;5l3l,63,4	N:aiwt,129,3;aiv4,112,886;1xr5,99,3;aivw,81,36;8xnv,71,7;78i0,67,4;r5m,62,51;8fx6,61,48;309i,56,3;53lm,55,3;8ph6,53,9;3k1i,52,94;w27,50,1;akrc,47,4;vyp,46,9~aiv4,112,886;3k1i,52,94;9d1e,33,90;r5m,62,51;8fx6,61,48;aivw,81,36;9d84,35,19;76oi,36,18;7f4g,30,15;949y,45,11;6hno,16,11;10d5,34,9;8ph6,53,9;vyp,46,9;9cla,2,9
